      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should position the audit results not as a sign of perfection, but as a \"cleaner\" baseline that provides the perfect opportunity to catch invisible threats the standard plan can't see. Frame the \"Advanced Continuous Monitoring\" as an insurance policy that capitalizes on their current safety to protect against rare, high-impact events they are currently unprepared to detect. Ultimately, present the upgrade as a strategic extension of their current success rather than an unnecessary expense, emphasizing that security must evolve from \"good enough\" to \"future-proof.\"",
